<SiteLayout title="Privacy — Zskylo">
  <section class="page-hero wrap legal-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Legal / Privacy</p><h1 class="hero-typewriter">Privacy <span class="text-blue">notice.</span></h1></section>
  <article class="wrap legal-content"><p class="legal-draft">This is a preliminary privacy notice. Please contact us if you have questions about how information shared with Zskylo is handled.</p><h2>Who we are</h2><p>Zskylo is a public-facing brand based in Imadol, Lalitpur, Nepal. For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@zskylo.com">hello@zskylo.com</a>.</p><h2>Information you choose to send</h2><p>If you contact us by email or phone, we receive the information you choose to share, such as your contact details and project enquiry. Please avoid sending sensitive personal information unless it is necessary for your enquiry.</p><h2>How we use information</h2><p>We use enquiry information to respond, discuss requested services and maintain relevant business communications. We do not sell personal information.</p><h2>Cookies and third parties</h2><p>This website is designed without advertising or analytics trackers. The site loads the Manrope typeface from Google Fonts; this may involve a request to Google when a page is viewed. A self-hosted font option should be used if avoiding that third-party request is preferred.</p><h2>Retention and your questions</h2><p>Information is retained only as needed for the enquiry and applicable business or legal purposes. For a request about information you have sent us, contact <a href="mailto:hello@zskylo.com">hello@zskylo.com</a>.</p></article>
</SiteLayout>
